      "blurb": "Special Tasks Group infiltration and intelligence operative",
      "publicNotes": "<p>Salarian STG operatives are mission specialists: small, fast teams that go where they aren't supposed to be and do things that officially didn't happen. They are not front-line combatants by preference, but when combat is unavoidable they bring precision, speed, and the unsettling calmness of someone who has already modeled three different scenarios for how this fight ends.</p><p><strong>Accelerated Mind:</strong> +2 to initiative. When rolling initiative, may attempt a free Recall Knowledge on one visible creature.</p><p><strong>STG Methods:</strong> Gains +1 circumstance bonus to Stealth and Deception.</p><p><strong>Kinetic Barrier:</strong> 50 Shield HP. Recharges 10 HP per turn.</p>",
